📚 Learning Assistant

A simple and interactive Learning Assistant web application built using Python and Streamlit.
The application helps students learn, understand topics, and interact with educational content through an easy-to-use web interface.

🚀 Features

- 📖 Learning assistance for students
- 💡 Simple and interactive interface
- 🤖 AI-based learning support
- 📝 Helps users understand educational topics
- ⚡ Fast and easy-to-use Streamlit web application

🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Streamlit
- AI / Machine Learning (if used in the project)

📂 Project Structure

Learning-Assistant/
│
├── app.py
├── requirements.txt
└── README.md

▶️ How to Run

1. Install Python

Make sure Python is installed on your computer.

2. Install the required packages

Open the terminal in VS Code and run:

pip install -r requirements.txt

3. Run the Streamlit application

streamlit run app.py

The application will open in your web browser.

🎯 Purpose

The main purpose of this project is to provide students with a simple digital learning assistant that can support their learning experience through an interactive web application.

